sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Partisipan (User)
    participant Flutter as Aplikasi Flutter Mobile<br/>(Layar, Reminder, Timer)
    participant FastAPI as Backend FastAPI<br/>(app/api/pre_purchase)
    participant MLEngine as ML Risk Service<br/>(PrePurchaseRiskPredictor)
    participant Database as PostgreSQL (Supabase)<br/>(consent, checks, decisions)
    participant Researcher as Peneliti (Admin)<br/>(export_pilot_data.py)

    %% 1. Input dan Cek Risiko Pra-Pembelian
    User->>Flutter: Input rencana belanja (nominal, kategori, merchant)
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/check
    FastAPI->>Database: Ambil saldo kas, pagu anggaran, target tabungan pengguna
    Database-->>FastAPI: Konteks keuangan aktual (UserStatsService)
    FastAPI->>MLEngine: extract_features() & predict() (7 fitur kontekstual)
    MLEngine-->>FastAPI: Hasil inferensi (skor risiko, risk_level, trigger_factors)
    FastAPI->>Database: Simpan log pra-pembelian (pre_purchase_checks)
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Return PrePurchaseCheckResponse (check_id, skor, dampak)
    Flutter-->>User: Tampilkan PrePurchaseResultScreen (peringatan, dampak anggaran)
    Note over Flutter: Stopwatch internal mulai mengukur durasi refleksi

    %% 2. Pengambilan Keputusan & Telemetri Refleksi
    User->>Flutter: Memilih aksi: PROCEED / ADJUST / POSTPONE
    Note over Flutter: Hitung decision_latency_ms (selisih waktu lihat s.d. klik)
    Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/decide (decision, decision_latency_ms)
    FastAPI->>Database: Cek status persetujuan etik (consent_records)
    alt Persetujuan Aktif (given = true)
        FastAPI->>Database: Simpan keputusan + decision_latency_ms (pre_purchase_decisions)
    else Persetujuan Tidak Ada / Dicabut
        FastAPI->>Database: Simpan keputusan murni (decision_latency_ms = null)
    end
    FastAPI-->>Flutter: Status RECORDED

    %% 3. Jeda Refleksi & Konfirmasi Pasca-Keputusan (In-App Reminder)
    alt Pilihan PROCEED (Belanja Berlanjut)
        Note over Flutter: PostDecisionReminderService menjadwalkan jendela 24-72 jam
        Note over User,Flutter: Waktu berlalu (antara 24 s.d. 72 jam kemudian)
        Flutter-->>User: Tampilkan Banner Pengingat Konfirmasi di Beranda
        User->>Flutter: Klik konfirmasi -> Isi PostDecisionFeedbackScreen
        Flutter->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/pre-purchase/feedback (was_impulsive, regret_score)
        FastAPI->>Database: Simpan evaluasi riil (post_purchase_evaluations)
        FastAPI-->>Flutter: Konfirmasi tersimpan & banner ditutup
    end

    %% 4. Ekspor Data Penelitian Pseudonim
    Researcher->>FastAPI: Jalankan CLI scripts/export_pilot_data.py
    FastAPI->>Database: SELECT data JOIN consent_records WHERE given = true
    Database-->>FastAPI: Dataset transaksi, keputusan, dan latensi refleksi
    FastAPI-->>Researcher: Ekspor CSV berlabel pseudonim (HMAC participant_code, zero PII)
